{"title":"The Eight Empresses Betrayed Me, Only to Deeply Regret It After Being Reborn","synopsis":"Lu Ye, Nine-Lives Heavenly Sovereign yang dikagumi semua orang, pada hari dia naik ke alam Immortal, justru dikhianati oleh delapan Empress yang dibesarkannya sendiri. Nine Heavens Sword Princess: “Karena kau, seluruh dunia memanggilku sebagai pelayanmu!” Fairy Hong Ling: “Kalau bukan karena kau, aku sudah menjadi pasangan abadi dengannya. Kau pantas mati!” Vermilion Demon Empress: “Kau bilang mereka yang menyakitiku? Justru yang menyakitiku adalah dirimu sendiri!” Dengan Space-Time Reversal, Lu Ye terlahir kembali. Di kehidupan baru ini, dia bersumpah tidak akan mengulangi kesalahan yang sama, dan membiarkan delapan wanita itu menghadapi nasib mereka sendiri!","alternative_title":"八女帝全背叛，重生悔到肠断","author":"番茄小说, 李3疯","artist":"熊漫社","genres":["Action","Ecchi","Fantasy","Harem","Martial Arts","Romance","Shounen","Tragedy"],"chapters":[{"id":"6ca1313f-f748-441d-91f0-b7214611dcce","number":"33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"id":"7e19d386-1397-40f7-917e-89857fc001ec","number":"32","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"325f6cdc-9858-48a5-ae31-d0e42e0e819e","number":"31","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"id":"b7479dc6-c0f4-481a-a891-354471deb32a","number":"30","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"def31fa1-66de-4e49-b93f-ef035eb2282b","number":"29","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"56414b99-1d6b-4485-895d-d4645a8b5f3d","number":"28","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"id":"b4ccb641-4bd9-475c-bdfc-d9d0daf66687","number":"27","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"id":"2ffea846-05cc-4173-a411-289545b5f155","number":"26","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"id":"e0fb9515-2355-409d-8c23-ae94fac8f023","number":"25","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"id":"bd7b9f3c-a4c0-4567-a1b3-f8486c8